  "name": "cleaned_nhanes_1988_2018",
  "identifier": "10.57967/hf/0260",
  "description": "Description: The National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES) provides data and have considerable potential to study the health and environmental exposure of the non-institutionalized US population. However, as NHANES data are plagued with multiple inconsistencies, processing these data is required before deriving new insights through large-scale analyses. Thus, we developed a set of curated and unified datasets by merging 614 separate files and harmonizing unrestricted data\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nguyenvy/cleaned_nhanes_1988_2018.",
